# Private key material: the Android Auto head-unit identity, signing keys and their passwords.
# Ignored by name anywhere in the tree, not only in tooling/private/, so a copy dropped in the
# wrong folder is not picked up by `git add .`. The pre-commit hook in .githooks/ is the second
# line of defence: it also refuses these files when they are added with `git add -f`.
aa_cert
aa_identity_data
privkey
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.der
release-signing.properties
sentry.properties
/archive/cfmoto-cloud-client-poc/
apps/android/app/src/main/res/raw/aa_cert
apps/android/app/src/main/res/raw/aa_identity_data

# Local CodeGraph index: machine-specific, 60-100MB, rebuilt by `codegraph init`.
/.codegraph/

